  characterName: Thakur Mohamed
  promptText: Tourists are breaking pieces of our living reef to sell as souvenirs.
    If I push for a ban on reef diving and souvenir collecting, my brother, who guides
    those tourists, loses his income. Do I protect the reef, or the only work our
    family has?
  leftAnswer: Yes, ban the souvenir trade; the reef is your life and must be protected.
  rightAnswer: "No, keep guided tourism; protect today\u2019s jobs while you look
    for alternatives."
